  "poang": "1/0/0",
  "typ": "standardavvikelsen noll",
  "t": "<p>Prickdiagrammet visar hur många timmar sex personer sov en natt. Vad är standardavvikelsen?</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 460 210\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Prickdiagram där alla sex prickar ligger på 7 timmar.\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:460px\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"458\" height=\"208\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#dce4ed\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#172b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"40.0\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"40.0\" y2=\"155\" stroke=\"#172b3a\"/><text x=\"40.0\" y=\"170\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#172b3a\">4</text><line x1=\"106.7\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"106.7\" y2=\"155\" stroke=\"#172b3a\"/><text x=\"106.7\" y=\"170\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#172b3a\">5</text><line x1=\"173.3\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"173.3\" y2=\"155\" stroke=\"#172b3a\"/><text x=\"173.3\" y=\"170\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#172b3a\">6</text><line x1=\"240.0\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"240.0\" y2=\"155\" stroke=\"#172b3a\"/><text x=\"240.0\" y=\"170\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#172b3a\">7</text><line x1=\"306.7\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"306.7\" y2=\"155\" stroke=\"#172b3a\"/><text x=\"306.7\" y=\"170\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#172b3a\">8</text><line x1=\"373.3\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"373.3\" y2=\"155\" stroke=\"#172b3a\"/><text x=\"373.3\" y=\"170\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#172b3a\">9</text><line x1=\"440.0\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"440.0\" y2=\"155\" stroke=\"#172b3a\"/><text x=\"440.0\" y=\"170\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#172b3a\">10</text><circle cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"140.0\" r=\"6.5\" fill=\"#2f6fca\"/><circle cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"125.0\" r=\"6.5\" fill=\"#2f6fca\"/><circle cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"110.0\" r=\"6.5\" fill=\"#2f6fca\"/><circle cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"95.0\" r=\"6.5\" fill=\"#2f6fca\"/><circle cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"80.0\" r=\"6.5\" fill=\"#2f6fca\"/><circle cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"65.0\" r=\"6.5\" fill=\"#2f6fca\"/><text x=\"240.0\" y=\"204\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#172b3a\">Sömn (h)</text></svg></div>",
  "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">Alla sex sov 7 timmar</p><p>Medelvärdet är 7, och inget värde avviker från det.</p></li><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">Sx när alla avvikelser är 0</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[S_x=\\sqrt{\\frac{0}{5}}=0\\]</div></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> 0 h.</p></div>",
  "familj": "Uppskatta och tolka spridning i diagram",
