  "poang": "1/0/0",
  "t": "<p>Sex löpare sprang 1 km. Deras tider i minuter, sorterade, var:</p><p>12, 15, 18, 22, 25, 30</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"380\" height=\"90\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 90\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sex sorterade tider: 12, 15, 18, 22, 25 och 30 minuter\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"378\" height=\"88\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#dce4ed\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"48\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#d9ecf2\" stroke=\"#216d87\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"44.0\" y=\"50.0\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#172b3a\" font-weight=\"bold\">12</text><rect x=\"78\" y=\"20\" width=\"48\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#d9ecf2\" stroke=\"#216d87\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"102.0\" y=\"50.0\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#172b3a\" font-weight=\"bold\">15</text><rect x=\"136\" y=\"20\" width=\"48\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#d9ecf2\" stroke=\"#216d87\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"160.0\" y=\"50.0\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#172b3a\" font-weight=\"bold\">18</text><rect x=\"194\" y=\"20\" width=\"48\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#d9ecf2\" stroke=\"#216d87\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"218.0\" y=\"50.0\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#172b3a\" font-weight=\"bold\">22</text><rect x=\"252\" y=\"20\" width=\"48\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#d9ecf2\" stroke=\"#216d87\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"276.0\" y=\"50.0\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#172b3a\" font-weight=\"bold\">25</text><rect x=\"310\" y=\"20\" width=\"48\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#d9ecf2\" stroke=\"#216d87\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"334.0\" y=\"50.0\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#172b3a\" font-weight=\"bold\">30</text></svg></div><p>Bestäm medianen. (Svara i minuter.)</p>",
  "s": "<div class=\"facit-v2 facit-stegvis\"><ol class=\"facit-steglista\" role=\"list\"><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">Sex tider: medianen ligger mellan den tredje och fjärde</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[12,\\ 15,\\ \\mathbf{18},\\ \\mathbf{22},\\ 25,\\ 30\\]</div></li><li><p class=\"facit-rubrik\">Medelvärdet av 18 och 22 minuter</p><div class=\"facit-matte\">\\[\\frac{18+22}{2}=20\\]</div></li></ol><p class=\"facit-svar\"><strong>Svar:</strong> 20 minuter.</p></div>",
  "familj": "Median, kvartiler och kvartilavstånd",
